  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Seabreeze Hideaway is your effortless 30A escape—where relaxed coastal living meets unbeatable convenience. Just a short stroll from the sugar-white sands and crystal-clear Gulf waters, this bright and stylish home invites you to slow down, breathe deep, and settle into beach mode.<br><br>Wake to soft morning light and ocean breezes, sip coffee on quiet mornings, and spend sun-filled days exploring everything that makes 30A so special. You’re perfectly positioned near Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, and The Hub, giving you easy access to boutique shopping, incredible dining, bike paths, and live music—while still enjoying a peaceful retreat at the end of the day.<br>Inside, the home is thoughtfully designed with a fresh coastal feel, comfortable furnishings, and plenty of space to unwind after beach days or sunset strolls. Whether you’re planning a family getaway, a couples retreat, or a friends’ beach weekend, Seabreeze Hideaway offers the ideal blend of privacy, style, and location.<br><br>Come experience laid-back luxury, walkable beaches, and the best of 30A—your private coastal retreat is waiting.<br><br>5-7 minute walk to Inlet Beach public beach access<br>5 minute walk to Inlet Beach shops and restaurants<br>12 minute walk to Rosemary Beach<br>Powell Lake 11 minute walk<br>Panama City, Florida Regional Airport 34 minute drive",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
